"问题2：关键岗位（护士、教师）留不住": "Problem 2: key workers (nurses, teachers) can't be retained",
"对策1：增加可负担住房供给（公房、空置税）": "Solution 1: more affordable housing (public housing, vacancy tax)",
"对策2：改善交通，让周边区域可选": "Solution 2: better transport so outer areas become an option",
"立场：优点大于缺点（但需自律）": "Position: the advantages outweigh the disadvantages (but it takes self-discipline)",
