"示例计划：按 B1 起点、听力口语偏弱、语法基础薄弱的情况制定；目标总分 7.5（四项各 7.5 左右），单科保底 6.5。每天约 3 小时，工作日不够可以挪到周末补。周次从你开始备考那天算起，可在「设置」里填你自己的开始日期和考试日期。": "Sample plan for a B1 starting level with weaker listening and speaking and shaky grammar. Overall target 7.5 (about 7.5 in each skill), minimum 6.5 per skill. About 3 hours a day; if weekdays fall short, catch up at the weekend. Weeks count from the day you start; set your own start and exam dates in Settings.",
