"做法": "How",
"每周节奏：周一到周五按上表练，周六做整套真题，周日复盘错题、整理口语素材。口语素材尽量用你自己工作或学习的真实经历，以后面试时也用得上。": "Weekly rhythm: Monday to Friday follow the table above, Saturday a full past paper, Sunday review your errors and prepare speaking material. Draw speaking material from your own real work or study experience; it will help in interviews later too.",
"从 B1 到 7.5 时间很紧。如果模考阶段离目标还差很多，可以推迟考期多练几周；如果是为了申请学校，也可以了解有条件录取或语言班衔接。": "Going from B1 to 7.5 is tight. If your mock scores are still far from the target, consider pushing the exam back a few weeks; if it's for university applications, you could also look into conditional offers or a pathway language course.",
"语法与口音": "Grammar and pronunciation",
"<b>用法：</b>每天先看当天规则和例句，再在《English Grammar in Use》（中级蓝皮）里找对应单元做练习，最后自己造 5 个句子，最好和你的工作或生活相关。“常错”一栏是中国学生最容易丢分的地方，写作和口语里要刻意避免。两周后语法不用单独学，在刷题和改作文时遇到哪里补哪里。": "<b>How to use:</b> each day read the rule and examples first, then do the matching unit in <i>English Grammar in Use</i> (intermediate, blue), and finally write 5 sentences of your own, ideally about your work or life. The \"common errors\" column shows where learners most often lose marks; avoid them deliberately in writing and speaking. After two weeks, stop studying grammar on its own and fix gaps as they come up in practice and essay correction.",
