"<b>先看这条：</b>考官受过识别背诵内容的训练，整段照搬模板会被看出来，写作还可能因为偏题或语言不自然被压分。正确用法是记住<b>结构和衔接方式</b>，内容一定用自己的话写。蓝色 <span class=\"blank\">[方括号]</span> 是要替换的部分。": "<b>Read this first:</b> examiners are trained to spot memorised material. Copying a template wholesale will be noticed, and in writing it can cost marks for being off-topic or unnatural. Memorise the <b>structure and linking</b>, and always write the content in your own words. Blue <span class=\"blank\">[brackets]</span> are the parts to replace.",
